title: The host replaces a word in every line of a file while the guest types in one of them: both end with the same text
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^row 01\nrow 02\nrow 03\nrow 04\nrow 05\nrow 06g1\.g2\.g3\.g4\.g5\.g6\.g7\.g8\.g9\.g10\.g11\.g12\.\nrow 07\nrow 08\nrow 09\nrow 10\nrow 11\nrow 12\n$

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 9000
tool edit
edit notes.txt 1 1
wait 1700
find line
wait 300
find replace-all row
wait 600
find close
wait 4500
mark host-after
wait 9000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
edit notes.txt 6 1
key end
wait 1200
type g1.
wait 200
type g2.
wait 200
type g3.
wait 200
type g4.
wait 200
type g5.
wait 200
type g6.
wait 200
type g7.
wait 200
type g8.
wait 200
type g9.
wait 200
type g10.
wait 200
type g11.
wait 200
type g12.
wait 200
wait 2500
mark after
wait 1500
key save
wait 3000
quit
wait 1500
